    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are an initiate of the Cult of the Dragon. You found, or were brought to, one of its cells, where you embodied the qualities dragon cultists prize: duplicity, secrecy, and determination. In exchange for your oath of service, the cult gave you the fellowship of other dragon worshipers and access to resources that can further your study of arcana and the occult.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.rB02hBDYKcISULgK]{Cult of the Dragon Initiate}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Deception and Stealth</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCalligraph]{Calligrapher's Supplies}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCalligraph]{Calligrapher's Supplies}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBottleGlass]{Glass Bottle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLamp0000000]{Lamp}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagManacles000]{Manacles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (5 flasks), 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRobe0000000]{Robe}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, 30 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
